<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">

<title>Rumus Sudut Rangkap, Setengah Sudut, dan Penurunan Pangkat</title>
<metadata>
  <md:content-id>m49396</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Rumus Sudut Rangkap, Setengah Sudut, dan Penurunan Pangkat</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Pada bagian ini, Anda akan:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>menggunakan rumus sudut rangkap untuk menentukan nilai eksak.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus sudut rangkap untuk memverifikasi identitas.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk menyederhanakan ekspresi.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus setengah sudut untuk menentukan nilai eksak.</item>
</list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>f88d2fa2-ce9a-467f-ad1b-25ccd8ddddc0</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
  <figure id="Figure_07_03_001"><media id="fs-id2526438" alt="Gambar dua landasan sepeda, satu berkemiringan curam dan satu berkemiringan landai.">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_03_001.jpg" />
    </media>

  <caption>Landasan sepeda untuk pengendara mahir memiliki kemiringan lebih curam daripada landasan yang dirancang untuk pemula.</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1368511">Landasan sepeda untuk kompetisi (lihat  <link target-id="Figure_07_03_001" />) harus memiliki ketinggian yang berbeda sesuai tingkat keterampilan peserta. Untuk peserta mahir, sudut antara landasan dan tanah harus  <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
  </m:math>  sedemikian sehingga  <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo>
    </m:mrow>
  </m:math>  Untuk pemula, sudut tersebut dibagi dua. Berapakah kemiringan landasan bagi pemula? Pada bagian ini, kita akan mempelajari tiga kategori identitas tambahan yang dapat digunakan untuk menjawab pertanyaan semacam ini.</para>


  <section id="fs-id1944514">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus Sudut Rangkap untuk Menentukan Nilai Eksak</title>
    <para id="fs-id1902399">Pada bagian sebelumnya, kita menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk fungsi trigonometri. Sekarang kita meninjau kembali rumus-rumus tersebut. <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">Rumus sudut rangkap</term> merupakan kasus khusus rumus jumlah, dengan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Penurunan rumus sudut rangkap sinus dimulai dari rumus jumlah,</para>
    <equation id="fs-id1388755" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </equation>

<para id="fs-id1017955">Jika kita misalkan  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> maka diperoleh</para>

    <equation id="fs-id1958300" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>

<para id="fs-id1691770">Penurunan rumus sudut rangkap untuk kosinus memberi kita tiga bentuk. Pertama, mulai dari rumus penjumlahan,  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  dan dengan memisalkan  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> diperoleh</para>

<equation id="fs-id2073447" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>    </m:mtext><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1679855">Dengan menggunakan identitas Pythagoras, kita dapat mengembangkan rumus sudut rangkap untuk kosinus ini dan memperoleh dua bentuk lain. Bentuk pertama adalah:</para>
    <equation id="fs-id1082227" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1874226">Bentuk kedua adalah:</para>
    <equation id="fs-id1154694" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1541852">Demikian pula, untuk menurunkan rumus sudut rangkap bagi tangen, gantikan  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  dalam rumus penjumlahan sehingga diperoleh</para>

    <equation id="fs-id1688220" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable>
   <m:mtr>
    <m:mtd>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr>
    <m:mtd>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr>
    <m:mtd>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<note id="fs-id1992296">

<title>Rumus Sudut Rangkap</title>


      <para id="fs-id1681037"> <term id="term-00002">Rumus sudut rangkap</term> diringkas sebagai berikut:</para>
      <equation id="Eq_07_03_01" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
</equation><newline />
      <equation id="Eq_07_03_02" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><newline />
<equation id="Eq_07_03_03" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation></note><note id="fs-id1578259" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1342627"><emphasis>Jika diketahui tangen suatu sudut beserta kuadran tempat sudut itu berada, gunakan rumus sudut rangkap untuk menentukan nilai eksaknya.
      </emphasis></para>
      <list id="fs-id2248451" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
        <item>Gambarlah segitiga yang merepresentasikan informasi yang diberikan.</item>
      <item>Tentukan rumus sudut rangkap yang sesuai.</item>
      <item>Substitusikan nilai-nilai dari segitiga ke dalam rumus.</item>
      <item>Sederhanakan.</item>
      </list>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_03_01"><exercise id="fs-id1764242">
        <problem id="fs-id1256954">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Sudut Rangkap untuk Menentukan Nilai Eksak yang Melibatkan Tangen</title>
          <para id="fs-id1491583">Mengingat bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  terletak di kuadran II, tentukan hal-hal berikut:</para>
         <list id="fs-id2182373" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
           <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
             <m:mrow>
               <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                 <m:mrow>
                   <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                 </m:mrow>
                 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
             </m:mrow>
           </m:math>
           </item>
           <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
             <m:mrow>
               <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                 <m:mrow>
                   <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                 </m:mrow>
                 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
             </m:mrow>
           </m:math>
           </item>
           <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
             <m:mrow>
               <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                 <m:mrow>
                   <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                 </m:mrow>
                 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
             </m:mrow>
           </m:math>
           </item>
         </list>

        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2193040">


          <para id="fs-id1418852">Jika kita menggambar segitiga yang merepresentasikan informasi tersebut, kita dapat menentukan nilai-nilai yang diperlukan untuk menyelesaikan soal pada gambar. Diketahui  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  berada di kuadran II. Tangen suatu sudut sama dengan perbandingan sisi di hadapan sudut terhadap sisi sampingnya, dan karena  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> berada di kuadran II, sisi samping berada pada sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dan bernilai negatif. Gunakan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">Teorema Pythagoras</term>  untuk menentukan panjang hipotenusa:</para>
<equation id="fs-id2303132" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="right">
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(−4</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>c</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>c</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>c</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="right">
    <m:mtd columnalign="right">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1208430">Sekarang kita bisa menggambar segitiga mirip dengan yang ditunjukkan di <link target-id="Figure_07_03_02" />.</para><figure id="Figure_07_03_02" class="small"><media id="fs-id1519642" alt="Diagram segitiga pada bidang x,y. Titik-titik sudutnya berada di titik asal, (-4,0), dan (-4,3). Sudut di titik asal adalah theta. Sisi dari (-4,3) ke (-4,0) membentuk sudut siku-siku dengan sumbu x. Hipotenusa di hadapan sudut siku-siku memiliki panjang 5.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_03_002.jpg" />
          </media>
        </figure><list id="fs-id1754093" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span>Mari kita mulai dengan menulis rumus sudut rangkap untuk sinus.
            <equation id="fs-id1298188" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id948689">Kita perlu menentukan  <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>  Berdasarkan  <link target-id="Figure_07_03_02" />, terlihat bahwa hipotenusanya sama dengan 5, sehingga  <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>  Substitusikan nilai-nilai ini ke dalam persamaan, lalu sederhanakan.</para><para id="fs-id1494112">Jadi,</para>
            <equation id="fs-id1316292" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>24</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
        <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>  Tuliskan rumus sudut rangkap untuk kosinus.
          <equation id="fs-id2347943" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        <para id="fs-id1793867">Sekali lagi, substitusikan nilai sinus dan kosinus ke dalam persamaan, lalu sederhanakan.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1530574" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>9</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>7</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
        <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>  Tuliskan rumus sudut rangkap untuk tangen.
          <equation id="fs-id2078890" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id2130326">Dalam rumus ini, kita memerlukan nilai tangen yang telah diketahui, yaitu  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  Substitusikan nilai ini ke dalam persamaan, lalu sederhanakan.</para>

<equation id="fs-id2121569" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>9</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>16</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>16</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>7</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>24</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>7</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
        </list></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example><note id="fs-id1864098" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_03_01">
        <problem id="fs-id2336091"><para id="fs-id1506209">Diketahui  <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>  berada di kuadran I, tentukan  <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1984359"><para id="fs-id1338288"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>32</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
        </exercise>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_03_02">
      <exercise id="fs-id1400362">
        <problem id="fs-id2327940">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Sudut Rangkap untuk Kosinus tanpa Nilai Eksak</title>
          <para id="fs-id2303223">Gunakan rumus sudut rangkap untuk kosinus guna menulis  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dalam bentuk <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1928247">
          <equation id="fs-id2038748" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup><m:mtext>sin</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id1167807">
          <title>Analisis </title>


        <para id="fs-id1514609">Contoh ini menunjukkan bahwa rumus sudut rangkap dapat digunakan tanpa mengetahui nilai eksak. Hal ini menekankan bahwa yang perlu diingat adalah polanya dan bahwa identitas berlaku untuk semua nilai dalam domain fungsi trigonometri.</para>
        </commentary>
      </exercise>
    </example>
  </section>
  <section id="fs-id2249050">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus Sudut Rangkap untuk Memverifikasi Identitas</title>
    <para id="fs-id1313018">Pembuktian identitas dengan rumus sudut rangkap mengikuti langkah yang sama seperti saat menurunkan rumus jumlah dan selisih. Pilih ruas persamaan yang lebih rumit dan tulis ulang hingga sama dengan ruas lainnya.</para>

    <example id="Example_07_03_03">
      <exercise id="fs-id728598">
        <problem id="fs-id2712986">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Sudut Rangkap untuk Membuktikan Identitas</title>
          <para id="fs-id2067948">Buktikan identitas berikut menggunakan rumus sudut rangkap:</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1169806" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1807013">


        <para id="fs-id2208344">Kita akan mengolah ruas kanan tanda sama dengan dan menulis ulang ekspresinya hingga sama dengan ruas kiri.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1478975" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id1364527">
          <title>Analisis </title>


        <para id="fs-id1351871">Proses ini tidak rumit selama kita mengingat rumus kuadrat sempurna dari aljabar:</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1205403" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mi>a</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
          <para id="fs-id2431590">dengan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  Kemampuan mengenali pola merupakan bagian penting dari keberhasilan dalam matematika. Meskipun suku atau simbolnya berubah, kaidah aljabarnya tetap sama.</para>
        </commentary>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id1897349" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_03_02">
        <problem id="fs-id2301016"><para id="fs-id1530074">Buktikan identitas:  <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1492750"><para id="fs-id1313281"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
</note>

    <example id="Example_07_03_04">
      <exercise id="fs-id1524820">
        <problem id="fs-id1316219">
          <title>Memverifikasi Identitas Sudut Rangkap untuk Tangen </title>
          <para id="fs-id1319888">Verifikasilah identitas:</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1486278" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1306097">


        <para id="fs-id1333908">Dalam hal ini, kita akan mengolah ruas kiri persamaan dan menyederhanakan atau menulis ulang hingga sama dengan ruas kanan persamaan.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1199236" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Rumus sudut rangkap</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Kalikan dengan suku yang menghasilkan pembilang yang diinginkan</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Gunakan identitas resiprokal untuk  </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id1849183">
          <title>Analisis </title>


        <para id="fs-id1302366">Ini merupakan kasus ketika ruas yang lebih rumit pada persamaan awal berada di kanan, tetapi kita memilih mengolah ruas kiri. Namun, seandainya kita memilih ruas kiri untuk ditulis ulang, kita akan bekerja mundur untuk mencapai kesetaraan. Misalnya, anggaplah kita ingin menunjukkan</para>
          <equation id="fs-id2884163" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        <para id="fs-id1493924">Mari kita mengolah ruas kanan.</para>

          <equation id="fs-id1199365" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:menclose>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1328304">Saat menggunakan identitas untuk menyederhanakan ekspresi atau menyelesaikan persamaan trigonometri, biasanya tersedia beberapa jalur menuju hasil yang diinginkan. Tidak ada aturan tetap mengenai ruas yang harus dimanipulasi. Namun, kita sebaiknya memulai dengan pedoman yang telah diberikan sebelumnya.</para>
        </commentary>
      </exercise>
    </example>


    <note id="fs-id1299752" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_03_03"><problem id="fs-id1174055"><para id="fs-id1174056">Verifikasi identitas: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1916203"><para id="fs-id2243554"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise></note>
  </section>
  <section id="fs-id1355314">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus Penurunan Pangkat untuk Menyederhanakan Ekspresi</title>
    <para id="fs-id1357641">Rumus sudut rangkap dapat digunakan untuk menurunkan  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">rumus penurunan pangkat</term>, yaitu rumus untuk menurunkan pangkat genap sinus atau kosinus dalam suatu ekspresi. Rumus ini memungkinkan kita menulis ulang pangkat genap sinus atau kosinus dalam bentuk kosinus berpangkat satu. Rumus-rumus ini sangat penting dalam matematika tingkat lanjut, khususnya kalkulus. Tiga identitas yang juga disebut rumus penurunan pangkat ini mudah diturunkan dari rumus sudut rangkap.</para>
    <para id="fs-id2467783">Kita dapat menggunakan dua dari tiga rumus sudut rangkap kosinus untuk menurunkan rumus penurunan pangkat sinus dan kosinus. Mulailah dengan  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  Selesaikan untuk  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>

<equation id="fs-id1434749" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id2448468">Selanjutnya, kita menggunakan rumus <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  Selesaikan untuk  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>

<equation id="fs-id1134317" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1105729">Rumus penurunan pangkat terakhir diturunkan dengan menulis tangen dalam bentuk sinus dan kosinus:</para>
    <equation id="fs-id2628300" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>         </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat.</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>         </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>         </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<note id="fs-id2900248">

<title>Rumus Penurunan Pangkat</title>


      <para id="fs-id1864092"> <term id="term-00005">Rumus penurunan pangkat</term> diringkas sebagai berikut:</para>
      <equation id="Eq_07_03_04" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
      <equation id="Eq_07_03_05" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
      <equation id="Eq_07_03_06" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
    </note><example id="Example_07_03_05">
      <exercise id="fs-id2042766"><problem id="fs-id2211041">
          <title>Menulis Ekspresi Ekuivalen tanpa Pangkat Lebih Besar dari 1</title>
          <para id="fs-id2893591">Tulislah ekspresi ekuivalen untuk <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  yang tidak memuat pangkat sinus atau kosinus lebih besar dari 1.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1823167">


        <para id="fs-id2164657">Kita akan menerapkan rumus penurunan pangkat kosinus sebanyak dua kali.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1546208" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk cos</m:mtext>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext> Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk cos</m:mtext>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id1863883">
          <title>Analisis </title>
          <para id="fs-id1995932">Solusi diperoleh dengan menggunakan rumus penurunan pangkat dua kali, seperti telah disebutkan, serta rumus kuadrat sempurna dari aljabar.</para>
        </commentary>
      </exercise></example>

    <example id="Example_07_03_06">
      <exercise id="fs-id1833921"><problem id="fs-id1154810">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Penurunan Pangkat untuk Membuktikan Identitas</title>
          <para id="fs-id1154815">Gunakan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk membuktikan</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1386362" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mfrac>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mfrac>
   <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
    </m:mrow>
   <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1517659">


        <para id="fs-id1512827">Kita akan menyederhanakan ruas kiri persamaan:</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1512831" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>

      </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
      </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id1615455">
          <title>Analisis </title>
        <para id="fs-id2715681">Perhatikan bahwa dalam contoh ini, kita mensubstitusikan </para>
          <equation id="fs-id1784090" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
          <para id="fs-id1059525">sebagai pengganti <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Rumusnya menyatakan</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1473243" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
          <para id="eip-id1893537">Kita misalkan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> sehingga <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> </para></commentary>
      </exercise></example>

    <note id="fs-id1753781" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_03_04">
        <problem id="fs-id1154772"><para id="fs-id1154773">Gunakan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk membuktikan bahwa <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>15</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1952833"><para id="fs-id1952834"> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk cos</m:mtext>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>Substitusikan rumus penurunan pangkat untuk cos</m:mtext>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>8</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>15</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
      </exercise>
      </note>
  </section>
  <section id="fs-id2177692">
    <title> Menggunakan Rumus Setengah Sudut untuk Menentukan Nilai Eksak </title>
    <para id="fs-id1615430">Kelompok identitas berikutnya adalah  <term id="term-00006">rumus setengah sudut</term>, yang diturunkan dari rumus penurunan pangkat dan dapat digunakan ketika suatu sudut berukuran setengah dari sudut istimewa. Jika kita mengganti  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> rumus setengah sudut untuk sinus diperoleh dengan menyederhanakan persamaan dan menyelesaikannya untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  Perhatikan bahwa rumus setengah sudut didahului oleh tanda  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>±</m:mo>      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> . Ini tidak berarti bahwa bentuk positif dan negatif sama-sama berlaku. Tanda yang dipilih bergantung pada kuadran tempat sisi akhir  <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
              </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  berada.</para><para id="fs-id2637834">Rumus setengah sudut untuk sinus diturunkan sebagai berikut:</para>
    <equation id="fs-id2637838" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2257759">Untuk menurunkan rumus setengah sudut bagi kosinus, kita memperoleh</para>
    <equation id="fs-id2257762" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1471943">Untuk identitas tangen, kita memperoleh</para>
    <equation id="fs-id1471946" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>            </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<note id="fs-id2223366">
<title>Rumus setengah sudut</title>

      <para id="fs-id2001532"> <term id="term-00007">Rumus setengah sudut</term> adalah sebagai berikut:</para>

      <equation id="Eq_07_03_07" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>α</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:msqrt>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><equation id="Eq_07_03_08" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>α</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:msqrt>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><equation id="Eq_07_03_09" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></note><example id="Example_07_03_07">
      <exercise id="fs-id2827946">
        <problem id="fs-id2827948">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Setengah Sudut untuk Menentukan Nilai Eksak Fungsi Sinus</title>
          <para id="fs-id2827954">Tentukan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  menggunakan rumus setengah sudut.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2281040">
          <para id="fs-id2281042">Karena <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> kita menggunakan rumus setengah sudut untuk sinus:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1507376" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>30</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
            </m:msup>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:msup>
               <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>30</m:mn>
               </m:mrow>
               <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id2020943">
          <title>Analisis </title>
          <para id="fs-id2594644">Perhatikan bahwa kita hanya menggunakan akar positif karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>15</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mtext>o</m:mtext>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah positif.</para></commentary>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id2784673" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1936207"><emphasis>Jika diketahui tangen suatu sudut dan kuadran tempat sudut itu berada, tentukan nilai eksak fungsi-fungsi trigonometri dari setengah sudut tersebut.</emphasis></para>
      <list id="fs-id1936213" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
        <item>Gambarlah segitiga untuk merepresentasikan informasi yang diberikan.</item>
      <item>Tentukan rumus setengah sudut yang benar.</item>
      <item>Substitusikan nilai-nilai dari segitiga ke dalam rumus.</item>
      <item>Sederhanakan.</item>
      </list>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_03_08"><exercise id="fs-id2023302">
        <problem id="fs-id1274798">
          <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak dengan Identitas Setengah Sudut</title>
          <para id="fs-id1274803">Mengingat bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  berada di kuadran III, tentukan nilai eksak dari:</para><list id="fs-id3068887" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
            <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item> </list>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1631212">


          <para id="fs-id1631214">Menggunakan informasi yang diberikan, kita dapat menggambar segitiga yang ditunjukkan di <link target-id="Figure_07_03_003" />. Dengan Teorema Pythagoras, kita memperoleh panjang hipotenusa 17. Oleh karena itu, kita dapat menghitung  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>17</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>17</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>

        <figure id="Figure_07_03_003" class="medium"><media id="fs-id2917157" alt="Diagram segitiga pada bidang x,y. Titik-titik sudutnya berada di titik asal, (-15,0), dan (-15,-8). Sudut di titik asal adalah alpha. Sisi dari (-15,-8) ke (-15,0) membentuk sudut siku-siku dengan sumbu x. Hipotenusa di hadapan sudut siku-siku memiliki panjang 17.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_03_003.jpg" />
          </media>
        </figure><list id="fs-id2917167" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span>Sebelum kita mulai, kita harus ingat bahwa, jika <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> berada di kuadran III, maka <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>180°</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>270°</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> sehingga <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>180°</m:mn><m:mo />
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>270°</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  Ini berarti bahwa sisi akhir  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> berada di kuadran II, karena <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>90°</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>135°</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>

            <para id="fs-id1912327">Untuk menentukan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> kita mulai dengan menulis rumus setengah sudut untuk sinus. Kemudian kita mensubstitusikan nilai kosinus yang diperoleh dari segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_07_03_003" /> lalu menyederhanakannya.</para>
            <equation id="fs-id3026942" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mtable columnalign="left">
      <m:mtr>
       <m:mtd>
        <m:mrow />
       </m:mtd>
      </m:mtr>
      <m:mtr>
       <m:mtd>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mtd>
      </m:mtr>
     </m:mtable>

    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>15</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>17</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>32</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>32</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>16</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>17</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2335322">Kita memilih nilai positif dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> karena sudut tersebut berakhir di kuadran II dan sinus bernilai positif di kuadran II.</para></item>
          <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Untuk menentukan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> kita menulis rumus setengah sudut untuk kosinus, mensubstitusikan nilai kosinus yang diperoleh dari segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_07_03_003" />, lalu menyederhanakannya.<equation id="fs-id1882356" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>15</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>17</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>17</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>17</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1823306">Kita memilih nilai negatif dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> karena sudut tersebut berada di kuadran II, tempat kosinus bernilai negatif.</para></item>
          <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Untuk menentukan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> kita menulis rumus setengah sudut untuk tangen. Sekali lagi, kita mensubstitusikan nilai kosinus yang diperoleh dari segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_07_03_003" /> lalu menyederhanakannya.<equation id="fs-id2233932" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>α</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>15</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>15</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>32</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>32</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2738260">Kita memilih nilai negatif dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>  karena  <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>  berada di kuadran II, dan tangen bernilai negatif di kuadran II.</para></item>
        </list></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example><note id="fs-id2235070" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_03_05">
        <problem id="fs-id2235079"><para id="fs-id2235080">Mengingat bahwa <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> terletak di kuadran IV, cari nilai eksak dari <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>α</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1762528"><para id="fs-id1762529"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_05_09"><exercise id="fs-id2923001">
        <problem id="fs-id2923004">
          <title>Menentukan Besar Setengah Sudut </title>
          <para id="fs-id2923009">Sekarang kita kembali ke masalah pada awal bagian. Sebuah landasan sepeda untuk kompetisi tingkat lanjut dibangun dengan sudut  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  antara landasan dan tanah. Landasan lain akan dibuat dengan kemiringan setengahnya untuk kompetisi pemula. Jika  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> untuk kompetisi tingkat lebih tinggi, apa ukuran sudut untuk kompetisi pemula?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1697988">

          <para id="fs-id1697991">Karena sudut untuk kompetisi pemula memiliki setengah kemiringan sudut pada kompetisi tingkat lanjut, dan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  untuk kompetisi tingkat lanjut, kita dapat menentukan  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  dari segitiga siku-siku dan Teorema Pythagoras agar kita dapat menggunakan identitas setengah sudut. Lihat  <link target-id="Figure_07_03_004" />.</para><equation id="fs-id2119600" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>34</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><figure id="Figure_07_03_004" class="small"><media id="fs-id2256401" alt="Gambar segitiga siku-siku dengan sisi 3, 5, dan sqrt(34). sqrt(34) adalah hipotenusa dan 3 adalah alasnya. Sudut antara hipotenusa dan alas adalah theta. Sudut antara sisi sepanjang 3 dan sisi sepanjang 5 merupakan sudut siku-siku.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_03_004.jpg" />
          </media>
        </figure><para id="fs-id2256411">Kita melihat bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>34</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>34</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>34</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  Kita dapat menggunakan rumus setengah sudut untuk tangen:  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
              </m:msqrt>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  Karena  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>  berada di kuadran pertama, demikian pula  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Jadi,</para>

<equation id="fs-id1539352" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
               <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                 <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>34</m:mn>
                 </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

               </m:mrow>
               <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>34</m:mn>
               </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

             </m:mrow>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
               <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                 <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>34</m:mn>
                 </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

               </m:mrow>
               <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>34</m:mn>
               </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

             </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>34</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>34</m:mn>
             </m:mrow>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>34</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.57</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id2132071">Kita dapat menggunakan invers tangen untuk menentukan sudut:  <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>0.57</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>29.7</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Jadi sudut landasan untuk kompetisi pemula adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>29.7</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </example><note id="fs-id2454710" class="precalculus media media-notitle">
      <label>Media</label>
      <para id="fs-id2454717">Akses sumber daya daring berikut untuk memperoleh penjelasan dan latihan tambahan tentang rumus sudut rangkap, setengah sudut, dan penurunan pangkat.</para>
      <list id="fs-id2034632">
        <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/doubleangiden">Identitas Sudut Rangkap</link></item>
        <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/halfangleident">Identitas setengah sudut</link></item>
      </list>
    </note>
  </section>
  <section id="fs-id2034648" class="key-equations"><title>Persamaan Utama</title><table id="fs-id2034654" summary="Tabel tiga baris yang merangkum rumus sudut rangkap, rumus penurunan pangkat, dan rumus setengah sudut." class="unnumbered unstyled"><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="left" />
        <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry><emphasis>Rumus sudut rangkap</emphasis></entry>
            <entry> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry><emphasis>Rumus penurunan pangkat</emphasis></entry>
            <entry> <m:math>
              <m:mtable columnalign="left">
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>

            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry><emphasis>Rumus setengah sudut</emphasis></entry>
            <entry> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>α</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>α</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>α</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
        </tbody>


</tgroup>
</table></section><section id="fs-id1792287" class="key-concepts">
    <title>Konsep Utama</title>
    <list id="fs-id1792293"><item>Identitas sudut rangkap diturunkan dari rumus penjumlahan fungsi-fungsi trigonometri dasar: sinus, kosinus, dan tangen. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_03_01" />, <link target-id="Example_07_03_02" />,  <link target-id="Example_07_03_03" />, dan <link target-id="Example_07_03_04" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus penurunan pangkat sangat berguna dalam kalkulus karena memungkinkan kita menurunkan pangkat suku trigonometri. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_03_05" />  dan  <link target-id="Example_07_03_06" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus setengah sudut memungkinkan kita menentukan nilai fungsi trigonometri yang melibatkan setengah sudut, baik sudut asalnya diketahui maupun tidak. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_03_07" />, <link target-id="Example_07_03_08" />, dan <link target-id="Example_07_05_09" />.</item></list></section>


  <section id="fs-id1596266" class="section-exercises"><title>Latihan Bagian</title>
<section id="fs-id1596270">
      <title>Verbal</title>
      <exercise id="fs-id1596275" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1596276"><para id="fs-id1596277">Jelaskan cara menentukan identitas penurunan pangkat dari identitas sudut rangkap  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2031068">
        <para id="fs-id2031070">Gunakan identitas Pythagoras dan pisahkan suku kuadratnya. </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2031074" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2031075"><para id="fs-id2031076">Jelaskan cara menentukan rumus sudut rangkap untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> menggunakan rumus sudut rangkap untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1703960" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1703961"><para id="fs-id1703962">Kita dapat menentukan rumus setengah sudut untuk  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dengan membagi rumus untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> Jelaskan bagaimana menentukan dua rumus untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
        yang tidak melibatkan akar persegi.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2165529">
        <para id="fs-id2165532"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>  dengan mengalikan pembilang dan penyebut masing-masing dengan  <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:msqrt>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:msqrt>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>  secara berturut-turut.  </para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2467445"><problem id="fs-id2467446"><para id="fs-id2467447">Untuk rumus setengah sudut yang diberikan dalam latihan sebelumnya untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> jelaskan mengapa pembagian dengan 0 tidak menjadi masalah. (Petunjuk: periksa nilai <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>  yang diperlukan agar penyebut bernilai 0.)</para></problem></exercise>

    </section>
    <section id="fs-id2084633"><title>Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id2084638">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan nilai eksak a)  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> (b) <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan c) <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> tanpa menentukan nilai <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para><exercise id="fs-id2141772"><problem id="fs-id2141773"><para id="fs-id2141774">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran I.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1910223">
        <para id="fs-id1910225">(a) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>32</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (b) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>31</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>32</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (c) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>31</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2160373"><problem id="fs-id2160374"><para id="fs-id2160375">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran I.</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2708435"><problem id="fs-id2708436"><para id="fs-id2708437">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran III.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2701889">
        <para id="fs-id2701891">(a) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (b) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (c) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2130388"><problem id="fs-id2130389"><para id="fs-id2130390">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran IV.</para></problem></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2126716">Untuk latihan berikut, temukan nilai dari enam fungsi trigonometri jika kondisi yang diberikan berlaku.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2126720" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2126721"><para id="fs-id2126722"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>90</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>180</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2056413">
        <para id="fs-id2056415"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1431936" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1431937"><para id="fs-id1431938"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msqrt>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>180</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>270</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2633017">Untuk latihan berikut, sederhanakan menjadi satu ekspresi trigonometri.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2633020"><problem id="fs-id2633021"><para id="fs-id2633022"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1575786">
        <para id="fs-id1575788"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
          </para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2915511"><problem id="fs-id2915512"><para id="fs-id2915513"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2079018">Untuk latihan berikut, temukan nilai eksak menggunakan rumus setengah sudut.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2079021"><problem id="fs-id2079022"><para id="fs-id2079023"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1267575">
        <para id="fs-id1267577"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1256220"><problem id="fs-id1256221"><para id="fs-id1256222"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2077632"><problem id="fs-id2077633"><para id="fs-id2077634"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2786197">
        <para id="fs-id2786199"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1613024"><problem id="fs-id1613025"><para id="fs-id1613026"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1274464"><problem id="fs-id1274465"><para id="fs-id1274466"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1541636">
        <para id="fs-id1541638"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1562395"><problem id="fs-id1562396"><para id="fs-id1562397"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1525779"><problem id="fs-id1525780"><para id="fs-id1525781"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2564653">
          <para id="fs-id2564655"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id1971088">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan nilai eksak a)  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> (b) <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan c) <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> tanpa menyelesaikan untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      
ketika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>0</m:mn>
          <m:mo>≤</m:mo>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
          <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> </para><exercise id="fs-id2030106" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2030108"><para id="fs-id2030109">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran IV.</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2823463" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2823464"><para id="fs-id2823465">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>12</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>13</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran III.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2156081">
        <para id="fs-id2156083">(a) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>13</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (b) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>13</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (c) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2633748" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2633749"><para id="fs-id2633750">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran II.</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1743158" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1743159"><para id="fs-id1743160">Jika  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> berada di kuadran II.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2234963">
        <para id="fs-id2234965">(a) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (b) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> (c) <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id1617236">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan <link target-id="Figure_07_03_201" />  untuk menentukan sudut setengah dan sudut rangkap yang diminta.</para>

      <figure id="Figure_07_03_201" class="small"><media id="fs-id1926556" alt="Gambar segitiga siku-siku. Alasnya sepanjang 12 dan tingginya 5. Sudut antara alas dan tinggi adalah 90 derajat, sudut antara alas dan hipotenusa adalah theta, dan sudut antara tinggi dan hipotenusa adalah alpha derajat.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_03_201-50f9.jpg" />
      </media>
      </figure><exercise id="fs-id1926566"><problem id="fs-id1926567"><para id="fs-id1926568">Tentukan  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">).</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2148715" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2148716"><para id="fs-id2148717">Tentukan  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">).</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1475701">
        <para id="fs-id1475703"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>120</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>169</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>119</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>169</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>120</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>119</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1929612"><problem id="fs-id1929613"><para id="fs-id1929614">Tentukan  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise><exercise id="fs-id2802108"><problem id="fs-id2802109"><para id="fs-id2802110">Tentukan  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1740865">
          <para id="fs-id1740867"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2780640">Untuk latihan berikut, sederhanakan setiap ekspresi. Jangan menghitung nilainya.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2780643"><problem id="fs-id2780644"><para id="fs-id2780645"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>28</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>28</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1754046"><problem id="fs-id2334589"><para id="fs-id2334590"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>37</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1615371">
        <para id="fs-id1615373"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>74</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
      </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1868300"><problem id="fs-id1868301"><para id="fs-id1868302"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>17</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1363902"><problem id="fs-id2067709"><para id="fs-id2067710"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1615565">
          <para id="fs-id1615567"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1806937"><problem id="fs-id1806938"><para id="fs-id1806939"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2164318"><problem id="fs-id2164319"><para id="fs-id2164320"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2906540">
          <para id="fs-id2906542"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2586821">Untuk latihan berikut, buktikan identitas yang diberikan.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2586824" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2586825"><para id="fs-id2586826"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2617871" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2617872"><para id="fs-id2617873"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2038541">
          <para id="fs-id2038543"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2116113" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2116114"><para id="fs-id2116115"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1919766" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1919767"><para id="fs-id1919768"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>


          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2259856">
          <para id="fs-id2259858"> <m:math>
            <m:mtable columnalign="left">
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                          <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow><m:msup>
                      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
            </m:mtable>

          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>


      <para id="fs-id2307988">Untuk latihan berikut, tulis ulang ekspresi dengan eksponen tidak lebih besar dari 1.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2307992"><problem id="fs-id2307993"><para id="fs-id2307994"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1217358"><problem id="fs-id1217359"><para id="fs-id1217360"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2296536">
          <para id="fs-id2296538"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2148526"><problem id="fs-id2148527"><para id="fs-id2148528"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1669604"><problem id="fs-id1669605"><para id="fs-id1669606"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2430149">
          <para id="fs-id2430151"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2595632"><problem id="fs-id2595633"><para id="fs-id2595634"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2261679"><problem id="fs-id2261680"><para id="fs-id2261681"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id505042">
          <para id="fs-id505044"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>32</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1341258"><problem id="fs-id1341259"><para id="fs-id1341260"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

    </section><section id="fs-id2957879">
      <title>Teknologi</title>
      <para id="fs-id1154359">Untuk latihan berikut, turunkan pangkat dalam persamaan menjadi satu, lalu periksa jawabannya secara grafis.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1154363"><problem id="fs-id1154364"><para id="fs-id1154365"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1154390">
          <para id="fs-id1154392"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id3460275"><problem id="fs-id3460276"><para id="fs-id3460277"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2477648"><problem id="fs-id2477650"><para id="fs-id2477651"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2896953">
          <para id="fs-id2896955"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2281010"><problem id="fs-id2281011"><para id="fs-id2281012"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1737544"><problem id="fs-id1737545"><para id="fs-id1737546"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1899787">
          <para id="fs-id1899789"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1617272"><problem id="fs-id1617273"><para id="fs-id1617274"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2738099"><problem id="fs-id2738100"><para id="fs-id2738101"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2185999">
          <para id="fs-id2186001"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2164535"><problem id="fs-id2164536"><para id="fs-id2164537"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2675176">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan secara aljabar fungsi ekuivalen yang hanya dinyatakan dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>  dan/atau  <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> lalu periksa jawabannya dengan menggambar grafik kedua persamaan.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1926621"><problem id="fs-id1926622"><para id="fs-id1926623"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1643962">
          <para id="fs-id1643964"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2796947"><problem id="fs-id2796948"><para id="fs-id2796949"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
    </section>
    <section id="fs-id2796973">
      <title>Pengayaan</title>
      <para id="fs-id1875788">Untuk latihan berikut, buktikan identitasnya.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1875791"><problem id="fs-id1875792"><para id="fs-id1875794"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1562320">
          <para id="fs-id2749007"> <m:math><m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:msup>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:msup>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:msup>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:msup>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <newline />
 <m:math><m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1086887"><problem id="fs-id1086888"><para id="fs-id1086889"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2609211"><problem id="fs-id2609212"><para id="fs-id2609214"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1790128">
          <para id="fs-id1790130"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2106580" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2106582"><para id="fs-id2106583"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id3032804" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1882179"><para id="fs-id1882180"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2569929">
          <para id="fs-id2569931"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1673817" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1673818"><para id="fs-id1673819"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2049232" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2049234"><para id="fs-id2049235"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1506517">
          <para id="fs-id1506519"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2042946"><problem id="fs-id2042947"><para id="fs-id2042948"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2234996"><problem id="fs-id2234998"><para id="fs-id2234999"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msup>
                  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2141255">
          <para id="fs-id2141257"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise>


    </section>
  </section></content>
  <glossary>
  <definition id="fs-id2253485">
<term>rumus sudut rangkap</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2253488">identitas yang diturunkan dari rumus penjumlahan sinus, kosinus, dan tangen ketika kedua sudutnya sama</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2253492">
<term>rumus setengah sudut</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2253495">identitas yang diturunkan dari rumus penurunan pangkat dan digunakan untuk menentukan nilai setengah sudut fungsi trigonometri</meaning></definition>
<definition id="fs-id2253499">
<term>rumus penurunan pangkat</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2253503">identitas yang diturunkan dari rumus sudut rangkap dan digunakan untuk menurunkan pangkat fungsi trigonometri</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>